; @brief  Ann's love event: she visits the farm when nLove_Ann reached 200 (slot 0, strcFlags.event4 bit $0E/$0F) and the
;         scene continues in the tool shop (slot 1, fAreaEvents_ToolshopHandler): she looks for her weather-cock. Dialogs
